<title>RUSSIA: Giant Russian Lomonosov diamond field to be sold.</title>
<headline>Giant Russian Lomonosov diamond field to be sold.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will hold an international tender this year to attract foreign investors to develop its giant Lomonosov diamond field, a regional official closely involved in the project said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The tender will be held this year,&quot; said Viktor Chernov, head of the natural resources and mineral base development department of the northern Arkhanglesk region, which has jurisdiction over the giant diamond deposit.</p>
</text>
